    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harry Brann Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market, this 5 bedroomed split-level residence with detached garage built on a large circa 0.80-acre site, located within walking distance of all amenities in the popular lakeside twin-towns of Ballina & Killaloe - Set in tranquil surroundings within mature enclosed gardens, Crofton represents an ideal family home for the would-be purchaser - Early viewing strongly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harry Brann Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market, this 5 bedroomed split-level residence with detached garage built on a large circa 0.80-acre site, located within walking distance of all amenities in the popular lakeside twin-towns of Ballina & Killaloe - Set in tranquil surroundings within mature enclosed gardens, Crofton represents an ideal family home for the would-be purchaser - Early viewing strongly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "To include - Entrance Hall, Lounge, Living Room, Kitchen/dining Area, 5 bedrooms - 2 En-suite, Family Bathroom & Utility."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": ""
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Services to include - Oil-fired central heating. Mains water. Septic tank. Alarm system. \r\nPVC double glazed windows. Outdoor sensor lighting.\r\nNeatly manicured lawned gardens with mature trees, hedges & shrubbery beds to the front, side & rear. \r\nWrought iron access gates in cut-stone entrance, leading to a kerbed meandering tarmacadam driveway.\r\nDetached Garage. Garden Shed. Boiler House. Outside tap.\r\nEasy access to all local amenities to include Shops, GAA, Rugby, Soccer, Athletics, Water Sports, Hiking, Primary/Secondary Schools & Doctor's/Dentist's Surgeries etc.\r\nUniversity of Limerick - 24kms (24 mins), Shannon Airport - 55kms (43 mins), J27-M7 Motorway - 6.1kms (8 mins) & Nenagh - 20kms (18 mins)."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
